│                          │ the next value before incorporating a measurement; this reduces phase lag relative to a   │
│                          │ moving average. Its gains increase during sustained high-slope motion to preserve genuine │
│                          │ dynamics, while a robust innovation scale clips isolated outliers and reduces             │
│                          │ noise-driven directional reversals. A slowly smoothed velocity estimate provides trend    │
│                          │ persistence without requiring a future-looking window, preserving real-time operation and │
