│ patch_description        │ Add a low-latency output-domain reversal gate to the Kalman filter. The current filter    │
│                          │ has strong tracking accuracy but excessive slope changes and false reversals, indicating  │
│                          │ that small posterior level fluctuations are being emitted as trend changes. The gate      │
