│                          │ has strong tracking accuracy and low lag, but its unconstrained level updates allow       │
│                          │ frequent one-sample direction changes. The gate maintains the accepted output trend       │
│                          │ direction, suppresses weak opposing moves within a volatility-scaled band, and requires   │
│                          │ repeated opposing evidence before releasing a reversal. Exceptionally large moves pass    │
│                          │ immediately so genuine sharp turns retain low latency. This specifically targets the high │
│                          │ slope-change and false-reversal metrics while preserving the causal filter and its        │
│                          │ responsive trend tracking.                                                                │
