│                          │ displacement, as the stable velocity reference. Fuse it with the robust recency-weighted  │
│                          │ local regression slope. The fusion gives more weight to the accepted step when the local  │
│                          │ trend is weak relative to residual noise, suppressing noise-driven reversals and slope    │
│                          │ jitter. As local trend strength grows, the direct regression contributes more strongly to │
│                          │ reduce sustained-trend lag. A residual-noise-scaled acceleration limit prevents a         │
│                          │ contaminated window from abruptly changing the Kalman slope.                              │
