│ patch_type               │ full                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ robust_hysteretic_trendfilter                                                             │
│ patch_description        │ This redesign replaces the prior Kalman/consensus structure with a robust endpoint        │
│                          │ local-polynomial tracker combined with a hysteretic directional controller.               │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ For every causal sliding window, the algorithm performs a clipped, exponentially weighted │
│                          │ local linear regression whose estimate is evaluated at the newest sample. This retains    │
│                          │ substantially less phase delay than a moving average while reducing the influence of      │
│                          │ impulsive samples. Raw window MAD is used only to protect the initial regression from     │
│                          │ extreme outliers. A separate residual MAD is then calculated after fitting; this          │
│                          │ distinguishes a clean ramp or curve from genuinely noisy data and controls confidence,    │
│                          │ smoothing, velocity adaptation, and reversal thresholds.                                  │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The fitted endpoint and local slope feed a predictive trend tracker. Unlike a             │
│                          │ conventional smoother, the tracker requires persistent, noise-significant opposite slope  │
│                          │ evidence before accepting a directional reversal. During pending reversal evidence, it    │
│                          │ decelerates toward zero rather than immediately changing sign. This reduces noise-driven  │
│                          │ trend flips while preserving responsiveness to sustained real reversals.                  │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
